cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Birdwatcher in your research, please cite this software."
type: software

title: "Birdwatcher: A Python computer vision library for animal behavior"

abstract: >
  Birdwatcher is a Python library for analyzing animal
  behavior using computer vision. It provides tools
  for movement detection, background subtraction,
  video processing, and behavioral data analysis.

authors:
  - family-names: Beckers
    given-names: Gabriel
    affiliation: Utrecht University

  - family-names: Mol
    given-names: Carien
    affiliation: Utrecht University

repository-code: "https://github.com/gbeckers/Birdwatcher"

license: BSD-3-Clause

keywords:
  - animal behavior
  - computer vision
  - movement detection
  - Python
  - behavioral analysis